            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An information processing apparatus 100 is characterized by including first inference means configured to perform a first inference by inputting an image feature amount obtained by performing image processing on medical image data to a first trained machine-learning classifier and to output a probability of a malignancy of a disease identified from the medical image data as a first inference result, and second inference means configured to perform a second inference by inputting, to a second trained machine-learning classifier, at least one of (a) an image feature amount obtained by performing image processing on the medical image data and (b) the first inference result, and to output information on image findings as a second inference result.</p>
